<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Smart Swimming Pool – Mqtt</title><link>https://smart-swimmingpool.github.io/tags/mqtt/</link><description>Recent content in Mqtt on Smart Swimming Pool</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://smart-swimmingpool.github.io/tags/mqtt/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>MQTT Configuration</title><link>https://smart-swimmingpool.github.io/docs/pool-controller/mqtt-configuration/</link><pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://smart-swimmingpool.github.io/docs/pool-controller/mqtt-configuration/</guid><description>
&lt;h1&gt;MQTT Configuration (Home Assistant Discovery)&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Pool Controller uses &lt;a
href="https://www.home-assistant.io/integrations/mqtt/#mqtt-discovery"target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Home Assistant MQTT Discovery&lt;/a&gt;
for automatic device registration. All devices appear automatically in Home Assistant
without any manual configuration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note&lt;/strong&gt;: The former Homie protocol support was removed in v3.3.0. The controller
exclusively uses Home Assistant MQTT Discovery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Configuration&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="configuration"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#configuration" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Configure your MQTT broker connection via the Web UI (Settings → MQTT tab):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MQTT Hostname/IP&lt;/strong&gt;: Your MQTT broker address&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MQTT Port&lt;/strong&gt;: Default 1883&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MQTT Username/Password&lt;/strong&gt;: Optional authentication credentials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After saving and rebooting, all entities appear automatically in Home Assistant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Via the REST API&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="via-the-rest-api"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#via-the-rest-api" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The MQTT settings can also be configured programmatically:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;curl -b &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;session=&amp;lt;session&amp;gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; -X POST &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; -d &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;type=mqtt&amp;amp;host=192.168.1.100&amp;amp;port=1883&amp;amp;username=mqtt_user&amp;amp;password=secret&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; http://&amp;lt;controller-ip&amp;gt;/api/config&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Home Assistant Entities&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="home-assistant-entities"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#home-assistant-entities" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The controller publishes the following entities via MQTT Discovery, grouped by type with their standard HA entity category:&lt;/p&gt;
