&lt;h3&gt;Events (Log stream)&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="events-log-stream"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#events-log-stream" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The controller publishes &lt;strong&gt;curated log events&lt;/strong&gt; as an HA &lt;code&gt;event&lt;/code&gt; entity (for
automations and notifications) plus a &lt;strong&gt;raw log stream&lt;/strong&gt; for external tools:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Function&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;HA component/object-id&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Entity Category&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Topic&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Curated log events&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;event/logs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;diagnostic&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;homeassistant/event/pool-controller/logs/state&lt;/code&gt; (discovery &lt;code&gt;.../config&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery topic&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;homeassistant/event/pool-controller/logs/config&lt;/code&gt;
(&lt;code&gt;&amp;quot;platform&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;event&amp;quot;&lt;/code&gt;) with &lt;code&gt;event_types&lt;/code&gt;:
&lt;code&gt;LOG_WARN&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;LOG_ERROR&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;MODE_CHANGED&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;PUMP_ON&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;PUMP_OFF&lt;/code&gt;,
&lt;code&gt;WIFI_CONNECTED&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;WIFI_DISCONNECTED&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;MQTT_CONNECTED&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;MQTT_DISCONNECTED&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;State payload&lt;/strong&gt; (published on change only, deduplicated by log sequence):
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;event_type&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;MODE_CHANGED&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;message&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;Mode switched to auto&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raw stream&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;pool-controller/log&lt;/code&gt; (JSON Lines, WARN/ERROR only):
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;seq&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;42&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;t&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;123456&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;level&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;warning&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;msg&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;...&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Entity Category Reference&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="entity-category-reference"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#entity-category-reference" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Category&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;em&gt;(none)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Primary measurements, shown on the device front page&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;control&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Primary controls (switches, mode selection)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;config&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Configuration values and settings&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;diagnostic&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Device diagnostics and system information&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Features&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="features"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#features" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;All entities support:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Temperature sensors (pool, solar, controller)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relay switches (pool pump, solar pump)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operation modes (auto, manual, boost, timer)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Temperature-based circulation parameters (threshold, factor, max runtime)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configuration via MQTT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;State monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Home Assistant Dashboard Example&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="home-assistant-dashboard-example"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#home-assistant-dashboard-example" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;A ready-to-use Lovelace dashboard example with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;quick mode switching (&lt;code&gt;auto&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;timer&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;boost&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;manu&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;highlighted pool and solar/storage temperatures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a dedicated configuration view&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a combined history chart for switching times and temperatures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;is available in:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a
href="home-assistant-dashboard-pool.yaml"&gt;&lt;code&gt;docs/home-assistant-dashboard-pool.yaml&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Migration from Homie (Pre-v3.3.0)&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="migration-from-homie-pre-v330"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#migration-from-homie-pre-v330" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you&amp;rsquo;re upgrading from an older firmware that used the Homie protocol:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Homie protocol has been removed&lt;/strong&gt; in v3.3.0 — the controller now uses
&lt;strong&gt;Home Assistant MQTT Discovery exclusively&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;After flashing the new firmware, &lt;strong&gt;delete stale retained Homie messages&lt;/strong&gt;
from your MQTT broker to avoid confusion:
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;mosquitto_pub -h broker -t homie -n -r
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;mosquitto_sub -t &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;homie/#&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; -v &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; cut -d&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39; &amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; -f1 &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; xargs -I&lt;span class="o"&gt;{}&lt;/span&gt; mosquitto_pub -h broker -t &lt;span class="o"&gt;{}&lt;/span&gt; -n -r&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In Home Assistant, delete the old device entry (Settings → Devices &amp;amp; services →
MQTT → Devices → pool-controller → Delete) — the new entities will appear
automatically via MQTT Discovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reboot the device to trigger fresh discovery announcements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>